<title>USA: Frontier Cellular names president, COO.</title>
<headline>Frontier Cellular names president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frontier Cellular, a joint venture between Frontier Corp and Bell Atlantic NYNEX Mobile Communications, said Friday it named Ronald Boillat president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds Donna Reeves, who was named vice president of Frontier Corp's long-distance Western sales division.</p>
<p>Boillat joined Frontier Cellular in April 1995 as vice president of sales.</p>
